WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
Night in a forest.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.780
A very tall, hooded figure
looks up at the moon.

3
00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:09.440
Then the same figure,
outside a lit cottage window,

4
00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.620
watching a family inside.

5
00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.090
Then holding an open book.

6
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:17.270
Then alone, high on a glacier.

7
00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:21.360
Up on the ice, he says: "I
was benevolent and good".

8
00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.640
So what turns him into a killer?

9
00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.580
In this mission, you'll follow
the Creature's education,

10
00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:33.830
step by step: light, cold, hunger,
fire, then language and books.

11
00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.220
You'll find he's no silent monster.

12
00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:40.150
He tells his own story, in
calm, eloquent language.

13
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.810
And you'll notice that Shelley
never even gives him a name.

14
00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:47.880
Your mission: work out what
turns the Creature into a killer.
